{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/3dcd8c284fdcdc2619ea869b096b5c9c.avif?t=1762439610\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to classic 80s video games and the chaos of the human mind, <i>Anxiety Arcade</i> invites you to stop, breathe, and press A to start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no way to win. There\u2019s no final boss.<br>Only strange rooms, half-remembered memories, and hidden mini-games buried under layers of noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room is a song in an album \u2014 each puzzle another step deeper into your own head. <br>Bleak, funny, and bizarre, <i>Anxiety Arcade</i> looks at anxiety\u00a0through the lens of those that experience it, rather than trying yo fix it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as a full-sized arcade machine, <strong>Anxiety Arcade</strong> is a narrative game exploring themes of anxiety, isolation, and looping thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Closed Forum</strong>, made possible thanks to public funding from the National Lottery through Arts Council England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/6afe382eb1fdbe320872260048e5b1a1.avif?t=1762439610\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-inspired mini-games</strong> and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal narrative world</strong> that blends humour and melancholy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack by Jack The Robot.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20\u201330 minutes</strong> of gameplay, with reasons to replay and discover more.</p></li></ul><p 