ation, and looping thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>Closed Forum</strong>, made possible thanks to public funding from the National Lottery through Arts Council England.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/extras/6afe382eb1fdbe320872260048e5b1a1.avif?t=1762439610\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-inspired mini-games</strong> and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal narrative world</strong> that blends humour and melancholy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack by Jack The Robot.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20\u201330 minutes</strong> of gameplay, with reasons to replay and discover more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Closed Forum"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114990/571064201b5e508c02ab07cdacff455049d063ff/header.jpg?t=1762439610","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Anxiety Arcade","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 620 or GeForce GTX 650 / Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10